      "id":"working-vs-fact","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-working-persistent-memory",
      "question":"工作记忆和持久事实有什么区别？","aliases":["当前目标要永久保存吗"],"keywords":["工作记忆","持久事实","当前目标","永久保存"],
      "diagnostic":"先判断信息只服务当前run还是需要跨run使用。","hints":["查看 #concept-working-persistent-memory。","检查工作记忆是否写入memory_facts。"],
      "example":"当前目标只属于当前run。","answer":"工作记忆随run结束；持久事实跨run使用，必须带主体、来源、同意和TTL。",
      "source":{"label":"工作与持久记忆","href":"#concept-working-persistent-memory"},"updated_at":"2026-07-30","recommended":true
    },
    {
      "id":"memory-source","lesson_id":"agent-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-working-persistent-memory",
      "question":"为什么记忆必须有来源？","aliases":["source ID 可以为空吗"],"keywords":["记忆来源","source ID","为空"],
      "diagnostic":"检查事实是否能回到明确采集或确认入口。","hints":["查看 #concept-working-persistent-memory。","运行source必填测试。"],
      "example":"profile-form。","answer":"来源让事实可核查、撤回和解释；空来源记录被拒绝。",
      "source":{"label":"工作与持久记忆","href":"#concept-working-persistent-memory"},"updated_at":"2026-07-30","recommended":true
    },
    {
