      "diagnostic":"区分记录存在与允许使用。","hints":["查看 #concept-filter-before-budget。","检查eligible_facts的consent条件。"],
      "example":"已保存但eligible为0。","answer":"不能；装配前必须通过同意门禁，记录存在不代表可使用。",
      "source":{"label":"资格过滤与预算","href":"#concept-filter-before-budget"},"updated_at":"2026-07-30","recommended":true
    },
